 make AWS RPC extractors instance-owned.\n- **Nested RPC:** Prevent old-only metrics from inheriting a dual-emitting parent\u2019s method.\n- **Compatibility:** Preserve existing factory signatures. Default RPC factories, including `RpcClientMetrics.get()` and `RpcSpanNameExtractor.create(getter)`, now capture configuration from the current global instance when called. Explicit overloads use the supplied instance. Database, messaging, and code conventions are already fixed and remain unchanged.\n\n<!-- START COPILOT CODING AGENT SUFFIX -->\n\n- Fixes #20135","title":"Make semantic convention selection OpenTelemetry instance-scoped"},"mode":"publish","pr":20474,"pr_author_id":198982749,"protocol":"git-candidate-v1","publication":{"auth_mode":"fine_grained_pat","authorized_actor_id":218610,"authorized_at":1791577077,"generation":3,"max_pipelines":5,"phase":"7deba9e0b416445aa5e46a5307c98ea7","profile":"git-candidate-v1","required_checks":["Analyze (actions)","Analyze Java (none)","Analyze Kotlin (manual)","CodeQL","EasyCLA","build / build-servlet-images","build / common / build","build / common / check-gh-aw-lockfiles","build / common / examples","build / common / fossa-configuration-check","build / common / gradle-plugins","build / common / license-check","build / common / repo-checks","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, jetty)","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, liberty)","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, other)","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, payara)","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, spring-aot)","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, tomcat)","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, tomee)","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, websphere)","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, wildfly)","build / common / spotless","build / common / test0 (11, hotspot)","build / common / test0 (17, hotspot)","build / common / test0 (21, hotspot)","build / common / test0 (25, hotspot)","build / common / t